# Kenrith, the Returned King: "{4}{B}: Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under its owner's
# control." Bot2 Lightning Bolts both Ornithopters on turn 2, so each graveyard holds an Ornithopter. On turn 3 Bot1 has
# five sources but none black (Jet is drawn later), so the ability is refused; Jet is cast, and a Lightning Bolt in a graveyard
# is no target. It pays with Jet and four others (Sapphire stays untapped) and brings back Bot1's own Ornithopter. On turn 5
# it brings back Bot2's, which returns under Bot2's control (its owner), not Bot1's.

